{"context": {"change": "Made the README more actionable while keeping the local-first, lightweight scope.", "files": ["./memo-alt/README.md"], "target": "./memo-alt"}, "last_checkpoint": "updating_project_guidelines", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "./memo-alt/README.md || # Memo-Alt Project Guidelines\n\nMemo-Alt is a cost-efficient, local-first alternative for lightweight memo storage.\n\n## Design Goals\n- Keep notes in lightweight Markdown files.\n- Use fast file-based indexing with minimal dependencies.\n- Prefer local processing to reduce latency and operating cost.\n- Keep the structure simple enough to inspect and maintain manually.\n\n## Roadmap\n- Implement fast file-based indexing.\n- Maintain lightweight Markdown notes.\n- Add incremental indexing so unchanged files are skipped.\n- Add simple search over the index.\n- Measure indexing and search performance before adding complexity.\n", "op_name": "write"}, "last_tool_result": "Successfully wrote to ./memo-alt/README.md", "remaining_work": ["verify README changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
