2FB6E837AADD22F39DB612B2A43229F515809: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/0A686AAE0361AB3099A056E899EB06767D92D453: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/8C860F43C7E7B91EFB2E285FE5E86FAC03794B65: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/8B187C0A18AF282A9CCD9C4D02E564D026F2090D: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/684700B52E367D543975DF2FBB2001D929F62A28: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/55715DAB3083924FF0ECDAE61323A1FF87496DDD: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/312111615F60FDD66E84FB3C964D4C8DA3AFB5E0: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/C0913EB3E01E8AB42DF0E10FD4F6BE911B07D5AE: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/6B569C6C7AE655E8D0F7E8B2C09E20C47C904D4C: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/390B7757625A82AC01BE42CF95EEBC2C6E896A90: binary file matches\ngrep: ./user_data/cache2/entries/B8555219FE9DF5274A85A05C7944923F9FEFDF90: binary file matches\n[Command timed out after 30 seconds]", "remaining_work": ["find conversation saving function", "add date handling during save", "verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
