, art, and music teams collectively voted to permanently shut down active content development for the mod. Furthermore, many contributors requested that their assets and music be pulled from the project, making further updates practically impossible.  Wikipedia+ 1While the existing version of the Calamity Mod remains downloadable and playable via tModLoader, Ozzatron's fallout marked the definitive end of the project's official expansion.  Wikipedia\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Based on the conversation so far, suggest a short, descriptive, concise title (maximum 5 words, no quotes, no punctuation at the end). Return ONLY the title.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"llm\",\n      \"content\": \"The Calamity Mod Controversy\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "remaining_work": ["transform memory/conversations.json into the new entities format with name, date, and messages", "write back the updated data", "verify the result"], "status": "in_progress"}
